
>> Size := Objek baru.
Size saat: ['is:'] lakukan: { :angka
	angka saat: ['+'] lakukan: { :angka
		>> unit := angka satuan.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		kasus: ['inch'] lakukan: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- diri + (angka * factor).
	}. <- angka.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Keluaran tulis: plank + edge, baris-baru.
